---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Workflow Scan — €2,500"
  description="Bring two or three candidate workflows and receive a management-ready recommendation naming the first one worth pursuing and why."
>
  <PageHero
    label="Start here — €2,500"
    title='Find the first workflow <span class="text-ms-green-400">worth rebuilding.</span>'
    subtitle="Bring two or three candidate workflows. Leave with a management-ready recommendation naming the first one worth pursuing—and why."
  />

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.85fr] gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">The question</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight">Where can AI improve real work—not merely decorate it?</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">We compare two or three workflows from one team or business area using the same criteria: value, friction, feasibility, risk, knowledge availability, and dependence on human judgment.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">You leave knowing which workflow deserves the next euro—and which ones do not.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-ms-dark-900 border border-ms-green-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">At a glance</p>
        <dl class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <div><dt class="text-sm text-gray-500">Price</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">€2,500</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-sm text-gray-500">Format</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-white">90-minute diagnostic + 45-minute results session</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-sm text-gray-500">Scope</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-white">One business area, two or three workflows</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-sm text-gray-500">Output</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-white">AI Workflow Recommendation</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a href="/contact" data-conversion="ai-workflow-scan-call" data-placement="scan-summary" class="block mt-8 bg-ms-green-500 hover:bg-ms-green-400 text-ms-dark-900 px-7 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-center transition">Discuss a Scan →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">What happens</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold max-w-3xl">Enough evidence to make a decision. No theatre required.</h2>
      <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          ['01', 'Bring the candidates', 'A short sponsor questionnaire names two or three workflows and a concise material pack supplies the available evidence.'],
          ['02', 'Inspect the work', 'A 90-minute diagnostic session compares up to three workflows with the sponsor and up to three relevant participants.'],
          ['03', 'Get the recommendation', 'We analyze the candidates, prepare a management-ready recommendation, and present it in a 45-minute results session.']
        ].map(([number, title, text]) => (
          <div class="bg-ms-dark-800 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
            <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold">{number}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">{title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">{text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Your AI Workflow Recommendation</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
          <li>→ Comparison of two or three candidate workflows</li>
          <li>→ One recommended starting workflow</li>
          <li>→ First human-and-AI system outline</li>
          <li>→ Expected upside using available evidence</li>
          <li>→ Risks, prerequisites, and evidence gaps</li>
          <li>→ Recommended next move</li>
          <li>→ 45-minute results session</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">This is not</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-400">
          <li>× A detailed future-state workflow design</li>
          <li>× Separate stakeholder interviews or open-ended discovery</li>
          <li>× Technical architecture or vendor selection</li>
          <li>× A prototype or production implementation</li>
          <li>× An organization-wide AI strategy</li>
          <li>× A guaranteed ROI number without baseline evidence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">Bring the candidates. Leave with the recommendation.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-400">The qualification call tests whether the Scan is the right place to begin. If it is not, we will say so.</p>
      <a href="/contact" data-conversion="ai-workflow-scan-call" data-placement="scan-footer" class="inline-block mt-10 bg-ms-green-500 hover:bg-ms-green-400 text-ms-dark-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg transition">Discuss an AI Workflow Scan</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
